{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you always dreamed of running your own pawn shop? Now it's possible with MyPawnShop!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387230/extras/SteamCapture01.png?t=1744358023\" /><br><br>You can buy and sell hundreds of items of many different types. Musical instruments, weapons, art objects and much more!<br><br>Become rich by negotiating with your customers when buying and selling.<br><br>Clean and repair your items to earn even more money, with different tools at your disposal (found at different vendors in the game).<br><br>Manage your store as you wish with different storage units available as well as your storage reserve to temporarily store your items to be repaired or cleaned.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387230/extras/SteamCapture05.png?t=1744358023\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387230/extras/SteamCapture06.png?t=1744358023\" /><br>Early Access:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MyPawnShop is already available but development is still ongoing to offer you as much content as possible. Follow the development directly in-game (on the main menu) or on Steam to be aware of the news.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MyPawnShop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387230/1c35e5e015bbef34f1a563f1468f458bfa6fd4cc.jpg"},{"name":"All Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387230/6f495345c4f61616263741da8c290ae9601d5784.jpg"},{"name":"All Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387230/be565b8244a69ae4485748e82eab76aacb023662.jpg"},{"name":"All Purple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387230/42db0ed9c0c0d4c0cd262c23659907c1aed3eb93.j